sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin
    participant UI
    participant API
    participant Approval
    participant LiveGate
    participant Hetzner
    participant Audit
    Admin->>UI: Request baseline live VPS set
    UI->>API: POST live Hetzner request
    API->>API: require FIDO2 step-up
    API->>Approval: assert approved_for_execution
    API->>LiveGate: evaluate env, allowlist, idempotency
    alt denied
      LiveGate->>Audit: live_cloud.vps_set_blocked
      API-->>UI: blocked_human_gate
    else allowed
      LiveGate->>Hetzner: create G1, G2, WORKLOAD
      LiveGate->>Audit: live_cloud.vps_set_created
      API-->>UI: executed_provider_mutation
    end
